# Line endings are frozen as committed. The tree carries a mix - Quartus generated
# files (.qsf, .sdc, the megafunction wrappers, rom/*.hex) are CRLF, hand written
# modules and the markdown are LF - and converting either way now would rewrite half
# the repository for no gain. What matters is that git does not silently change them
# per machine, which is what -text guarantees.
* -text

# Binaries: never diff, never convert.
*.sof binary
*.jic binary
*.pof binary
*.rbf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.wav binary
*.exe binary
